    fkg:hasIngredient heals-ing:Avocado,
        heals-ing:BlackPepperPowder,
        heals-ing:Butter,
        heals-ing:Cheese,
        heals-ing:ClassicMayonnaise,
        heals-ing:RedChilliFlakes,
        heals-ing:Tomatoes,
        heals-ing:WholeWheatBrownBread ;
    fkg:hasInstruction """To begin making the Avocado Cheese Chilli Toast, take each bread slices and apply butter evenly on either side, sufficient enough to toast the bread.Heat a skillet and put the slice on it.
Let it cook on medium for 2 to 4 minutes on either side, or until bread is toasted.Once done, spread a thin layer or mayonnaise on each slice of bread.Put tomato and avocado slices and sprinkle black pepper powder + red chilli flakes on each toast.
Top each toast with some grated cheese.Serve Avocado Cheese Chilli Toast with Espresso Coffee for your tea time break."""^^xsd:string ;
    fkg:hasURL "https://www.archanaskitchen.com/avocado-cheese-chilli-toast-recipe"^^xsd:anyURI ;
