    fkg:hasInstruction """To make Banana Pomegranate Raita, firstly add curd, salt, red chili powder, sugar, Dejon mustard and cumin powder in a bowl.
Mix well.
After mixing, add pomegranate and banana.
Put the bowl in the fridge for 2 hours and mix.
Serve.
