    fkg:hasInstruction """To make the Kachumbar salad, mix cucumber, onion, green chillies, tomatoes, carrots and pomegranates in a mixing bowl.
Mix well.
After mixing, add lemon juice, black pepper powder, cumin powder, salt and mix well.
Now add green coriander, mint and mix well.
Serve Serve the Kachumbar Salad with punchy lentils, Aloo Bhindi Ki Sabzi and Phulka for dinner."""^^xsd:string ;
    fkg:hasURL "https://www.archanaskitchen.com/kachumber-salad-recipe-with-cucumber-onion-tomatoes-in-hindi"^^xsd:anyURI ;
