    fkg:hasInstruction """To make the Lemon Mint Mint Curry Curry Recipe, first of all mix the curry leaves, mint, lemon juice, cumin, jaggery, black salt in a mixer jar and grind it well.
Now add water and grind it again as per use.
Serve further to cool in the fridge."""^^xsd:string ;
