        heals-ing:WheatGrassPowder ;
    fkg:hasInstruction """To begin making the Super Food Green Smoothie Recipe, first prep all the ingredients and keep them handy.Add all the ingredients except the flaxseed and tulsi into a blender and make a smooth puree.
Add water or more soy milk if required to adjust the consistency of the smoothie.Pour the Super Food Green Smoothie into glasses, garnish with flax seeds and serve."""^^xsd:string ;
