        heals-ing:Salt,
        heals-ing:Watermelon ;
    fkg:hasInstruction """To begin making the Watermelon Carrot Radish Juice Recipe, first prepare the fruits and vegetables.
You can either use a juicer or a blender to make the juice.
If you use a blender, then you will have to strain the juice to consume.Place the watermelon, carrots and radish in the juicer and blend to extract the juice.
Once done, pour it into a glass jar, stir in a pinch of salt and squeeze some lemon to taste and serve.Serve Watermelon Carrot Radish Juice in the morning along with Grilled Rajma Masala Sandwich breakfast to give your day a refreshing start."""^^xsd:string ;
